  "body": "Auction this week!!\r\n\r\nAfter 48 years in the same family's care, this much loved home is finally ready for its next chapter.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 748sqm site (more or less) and positioned within the highly sought after Rangitoto College Zone, this spacious home offers an exciting combination of land, space and potential.\r\n\r\nInside, you'll find a generous living area flowing into an open plan kitchen, complete with a charming traditional fireplace, the perfect place to gather around and stay warm and cosy during the winter months.\r\n\r\nAll bedrooms are bright and beautifully sun filled, giving the whole family plenty of room to spread out.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the versatile rumpus room adds even more flexibility. Use it as a home office, a DIY workshop, a creative space or an extra room for the kids, the choice is yours.\r\n\r\nIt was the first home on the street, and that's part of its charm. With its established character, generous proportions and substantial land, there is plenty here to work with and make your own.\r\n\r\nA big home, a big piece of land, a great school zone, and plenty of potential for the future.\r\n\r\nCall Cam and Christina today - we would love to welcome you home!\r\n\r\nAuction Thursday 29th October at 12PM (Unless Sold Prior)\r\n\r\nTo download/view property documents please copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/R6TP",
